chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a cold sub-bass drone with a thin ringing bowed-glass tone over it}
{a reversed riser that slams into one massive deep brass blast on the last beat}

[Deal]
{a slow, swaggering, sinister groove at 100 bpm: a deep distorted sub bass pulse, a heavy half-time kick, percussion made of clinking glasses and bottles}
{on top a drunk, detuned old bar piano plays a sly, creepy little waltz-like melody that keeps coming back, more out of tune each time}
{it gets heavier and more threatening every 8 bars: low strings and a dark choir pad join, the drums double up, peaking wildly in the last four seconds}

[Reveal]
{it opens at once on a colossal horror explosion: huge deep brass blasts, a wordless dark choir, distorted drums, screeching strings}
{massive separate hits at 1 second, at 2.8 seconds and at 4.9 seconds, each bigger than the last, maximum terror}
{then it collapses into a ringing, shivering high string note that fades almost to silence by the end}
